text: >-
  Page 5 paragraph 3

  On 9112/2025, at approximately 0100 hours, FBI Special Agent Lange conducted
  an

  interview with the boyfriend of Tyler Robinson at the Washington County
  Sheriff's Office.

  The boyfriend was identified as Lance Twiggs. During the interview, Lance
  showed

  investigators text messages between Tyler Robinson and himself. The following
  is the

  content of those messages between Tyler Robinson and Lance Iwiggs.

  Tyler: "I am still ok my love, but am stuck in orem for a little while longer
  yet"

  Tyler: "shouldn't be long until I can come home, but I gotta grab my rifle
  still. To be

  honest had hoped to keep this secret till I died of old age. I am sorry to
  involve you"

  Lance: "you weren't the one who did it right????"

  Tyler: "I am, I'm sorry"

  Lance: "I thought they caught the person?"

  Tyler: "no, they grabbed some crazy old dude, then interrogated someone in
  similar

  clothing"

  Tyler: "I had planned to grab my rifle from my drop point shortly after, but
  most of that

  side of town got locked down. Its quiet, almost enough to get out, but theres
  one vehicle

  lingering"

  Page 5 paragraph 4

  Lance showed FBI Special Agent Lange additional text messages between Tyler
  Robinson

  and himself. The following is the content of those messages between Tyler
  Robinson and

  Lance Twiggs

  Tyler: "three hours ago there was an officer with a k9 walking nearby the
  area, hoping

  that pooch has a bad sniffer"

  because it sounds like the police couldn't get in for a long while because of
  the traffic"

  Tyler: "needless to say imma be late coming home, my b"

  Lance: "just stay safe"

  Tyler: "I will"
